      "filename": "Copper and calcite (Mesoproterozoic, 1.05-1.06 Ga; Pewabic Lode, Upper Peninsula of Michigan, USA) 3 (16679632374).jpg",
      "title": "File:Copper and calcite (Mesoproterozoic, 1.05-1.06 Ga; Pewabic Lode, Upper Peninsula of Michigan, USA) 3 (16679632374).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/Copper_and_calcite_%28Mesoproterozoic%2C_1.05-1.06_Ga%3B_Pewabic_Lode%2C_Upper_Peninsula_of_Michigan%2C_USA%29_3_%2816679632374%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Copper_and_calcite_(Mesoproterozoic,_1.05-1.06_Ga;_Pewabic_Lode,_Upper_Peninsula_of_Michigan,_USA)_3_(16679632374).jpg",
      "width": 2653,
      "height": 1989,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
